{"type":"message","id":"f34b24a9","parentId":"eaeb14a8","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:57:43.520Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我尝试用 message 工具直接发送消息给 search-agent。但首先，让我检查一下是否有其他方式来运行子 agent。\n\n看起来我需要换一种方法。根据任务描述，我需要协调多个 agent。让我尝试直接使用 exec 来创建和调用子 agent。","thinkingSignature":"d5b2c38bf36bb36877b60bdf67e13eb319727db5b77cc01848151e9ea965892b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ep1peaskdopf_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw message --help"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":7364,"output":81,"cacheRead":9107,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16552,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772117860343}}
{"type":"message","id":"2234b67e","parentId":"f34b24a9","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:57:45.001Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ep1peaskdopf_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — Siri's competent cousin.\n\nUsage: openclaw message [options] [command]\n\nSend, read, and manage messages and channel actions\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help   Display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  ban          Ban a member\n  broadcast    Broadcast a message to multiple targets\n  channel      Channel actions\n  delete       Delete a message\n  edit         Edit a message\n  emoji        Emoji actions\n  event        Event actions\n  kick         Kick a member\n  member       Member actions\n  permissions  Fetch channel permissions\n  pin          Pin a message\n  pins         List pinned messages\n  poll         Send a poll\n  react        Add or remove a reaction\n  reactions    List reactions on a message\n  read         Read recent messages\n  role         Role actions\n  search       Search Discord messages\n  send         Send a message\n  sticker      Sticker actions\n  thread       Thread actions\n  timeout      Timeout a member\n  unpin        Unpin a message\n  voice        Voice actions\n\nExamples:\n  openclaw message send --target +15555550123 --message \"Hi\"\n    Send a text message.\n  openclaw message send --target +15555550123 --message \"Hi\" --media photo.jpg\n    Send a message with media.\n  openclaw message poll --channel discord --target channel:123 --poll-question \"Snack?\" --poll-option Pizza --poll-option Sushi\n    Create a Discord poll.\n  openclaw message react --channel discord --target 123 --message-id 456 --emoji \"✅\"\n    React to a message.\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/message"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1459,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — Siri's competent cousin.\n\nUsage: openclaw message [options] [command]\n\nSend, read, and manage messages and channel actions\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help   Display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  ban          Ban a member\n  broadcast    Broadcast a message to multiple targets\n  channel      Channel actions\n  delete       Delete a message\n  edit         Edit a message\n  emoji        Emoji actions\n  event        Event actions\n  kick         Kick a member\n  member       Member actions\n  permissions  Fetch channel permissions\n  pin          Pin a message\n  pins         List pinned messages\n  poll         Send a poll\n  react        Add or remove a reaction\n  reactions    List reactions on a message\n  read         Read recent messages\n  role         Role actions\n  search       Search Discord messages\n  send         Send a message\n  sticker      Sticker actions\n  thread       Thread actions\n  timeout      Timeout a member\n  unpin        Unpin a message\n  voice        Voice actions\n\nExamples:\n  openclaw message send --target +15555550123 --message \"Hi\"\n    Send a text message.\n  openclaw message send --target +15555550123 --message \"Hi\" --media photo.jpg\n    Send a message with media.\n  openclaw message poll --channel discord --target channel:123 --poll-question \"Snack?\" --poll-option Pizza --poll-option Sushi\n    Create a Discord poll.\n  openclaw message react --channel discord --target 123 --message-id 456 --emoji \"✅\"\n    React to a message.\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/message","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772117864999}}
{"type":"message","id":"65fbefe4","parentId":"2234b67e","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:57:49.282Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"看起来我需要用不同的方式来协调子 agents。让我尝试通过直接创建任务文件来触发子 agent。或者我可以直接开始执行任务，因为 leader-agent 可以做很多工作。\n\n让我直接执行 search-agent 的任务 - 搜索 ANKI 和其他间隔重复软件的界面设计。我将直接使用 web_search 工具来完成这个任务，然后继续进行 design-agent 的工作。\n\n实际上，根据任务描述，我应该让专门的 agent 来做这些工作。让我尝试使用 agent 的方式。让我检查 openclaw agent 命令。","thinkingSignature":"61884c428e6aa9378677419d46728c1a999d1ef81d004f1a5c8a5b98532c5987"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8x9yk4fnil7u_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw agent --help"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":7821,"output":131,"cacheRead":9107,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17059,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772117865001}}
{"type":"message","id":"784d3082","parentId":"65fbefe4","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:57:50.849Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8x9yk4fnil7u_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — I'm the assistant your terminal demanded, not the one your sleep schedule requested.\n\nUsage: openclaw agent [options]\n\nRun an agent turn via the Gateway (use --local for embedded)\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>               Agent id (overrides routing bindings)\n  --channel <channel>        Delivery channel:\n                             last|telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|feishu|nostr|msteams|mattermost|nextcloud-talk|matrix|bluebubbles|line|zalo|zalouser|synology-chat|tlon\n                             (omit to use the main session channel)\n  --deliver                  Send the agent's reply back to the selected channel\n                             (default: false)\n  -h, --help                 Display help for command\n  --json                     Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  --local                    Run the embedded agent locally (requires model\n                             provider API keys in your shell) (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>       Message body for the agent\n  --reply-account <id>       Delivery account id override\n  --reply-channel <channel>  Delivery channel override (separate from routing)\n  --reply-to <target>        Delivery target override (separate from session\n                             routing)\n  --session-id <id>          Use an explicit session id\n  -t, --to <number>          Recipient number in E.164 used to derive the\n                             session key\n  --thinking <level>         Thinking level: off | minimal | low | medium | high\n  --timeout <seconds>        Override agent command timeout (seconds, default\n                             600 or config value)\n  --verbose <on|off>         Persist agent verbose level for the session\n\nExamples:\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"status update\"\n    Start a new session.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Summarize logs\"\n    Use a specific agent.\n  openclaw agent --session-id 1234 --message \"Summarize inbox\" --thinking medium\n    Target a session with explicit thinking level.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Trace logs\" --verbose on --json\n    Enable verbose logging and JSON output.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Summon reply\" --deliver\n    Deliver reply.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Generate report\" --deliver --reply-channel slack --reply-to \"#reports\"\n    Send reply to a different channel/target.\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agent"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1551,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — I'm the assistant your terminal demanded, not the one your sleep schedule requested.\n\nUsage: openclaw agent [options]\n\nRun an agent turn via the Gateway (use --local for embedded)\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>               Agent id (overrides routing bindings)\n  --channel <channel>        Delivery channel:\n                             last|telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|feishu|nostr|msteams|mattermost|nextcloud-talk|matrix|bluebubbles|line|zalo|zalouser|synology-chat|tlon\n                             (omit to use the main session channel)\n  --deliver                  Send the agent's reply back to the selected channel\n                             (default: false)\n  -h, --help                 Display help for command\n  --json                     Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  --local                    Run the embedded agent locally (requires model\n                             provider API keys in your shell) (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>       Message body for the agent\n  --reply-account <id>       Delivery account id override\n  --reply-channel <channel>  Delivery channel override (separate from routing)\n  --reply-to <target>        Delivery target override (separate from session\n                             routing)\n  --session-id <id>          Use an explicit session id\n  -t, --to <number>          Recipient number in E.164 used to derive the\n                             session key\n  --thinking <level>         Thinking level: off | minimal | low | medium | high\n  --timeout <seconds>        Override agent command timeout (seconds, default\n                             600 or config value)\n  --verbose <on|off>         Persist agent verbose level for the session\n\nExamples:\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"status update\"\n    Start a new session.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Summarize logs\"\n    Use a specific agent.\n  openclaw agent --session-id 1234 --message \"Summarize inbox\" --thinking medium\n    Target a session with explicit thinking level.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Trace logs\" --verbose on --json\n    Enable verbose logging and JSON output.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Summon reply\" --deliver\n    Deliver reply.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Generate report\" --deliver --reply-channel slack --reply-to \"#reports\"\n    Send reply to a different channel/target.\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agent","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772117870846}}
{"type":"message","id":"7e90729b","parentId":"784d3082","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:58:03.548Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我理解了。我需要使用 openclaw agent 命令来运行子 agent。让我尝试启动 search-agent。我需要查看如何指定目标 agent。\n\n根据 openclaw agent 命令，--agent 参数可以指定特定的 agent。所以我可以使用 --agent search-agent 来运行 search-agent。\n\n让我来搜索 ANKI 和其他间隔重复软件的界面设计。","thinkingSignature":"9053cb8baabbf7df44415af48bd9d16b24dca890e929d39c926d93166c7e7b59"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i5t2hkholv06_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"count":10,"query":"Anki spaced repetition software web interface design UI best practices"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":8535,"output":113,"cacheRead":9107,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17755,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772117870849}}
