{"type":"message","id":"86104e4f","parentId":"6a542b0d","timestamp":"2026-02-26T15:01:08.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我发现 CSS 中有一个错误：`padding 0;` 应该是 `padding: 0;`。让我修复它，然后创建 JavaScript 文件。","thinkingSignature":"756b8db3326c9e6a94cdb977ce80696d7c332e3955de3418c8a78af30e812755"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c9irp9j2f03s_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/styles.css","limit":20,"offset":360}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":19180,"output":92,"cacheRead":9107,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28379,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772118055259}}
{"type":"message","id":"e711e80f","parentId":"86104e4f","timestamp":"2026-02-26T15:01:08.927Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_c9irp9j2f03s_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":".btn-secondary:hover {\n  background: var(--border);\n}\n\n.btn-danger {\n  background: var(--danger);\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.btn-hint {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  padding: 10px 32px;\n}\n\n.btn-hint:hover {\n  background: var(--border);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n[377 more lines in file. Use offset=380 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772118068924}}
