{"type":"message","id":"775f4b63","parentId":"635cb9c1","timestamp":"2026-02-26T15:07:03.195Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在让我开始循环 2/2。","thinkingSignature":"3356a78324905eadd89d250983273a5e1adfe7da0125ed64cbad772e70d1c72d"},{"type":"text","text":"## 阶段 2：循环 2/2\n\n### 步骤 6：code-agent - 增强功能\n\n让我添加一些改进功能：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oan3ul6iz3u1_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# FSRS Web UI - 第二次迭代更新\n\n## 新增功能\n\n### 1. 移动端响应式优化\n- 侧边栏自动折叠\n- 评分按钮移动端适配\n- 触摸滑动支持\n\n### 2. 用户体验改进\n- 卡片翻转动画\n- 键盘快捷键支持\n- 加载状态提示\n\n### 3. 数据安全\n- 删除二次确认\n- 操作成功/失败提示\n","path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/CHANGELOG.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":32745,"output":189,"cacheRead":9107,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42041,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772118417674}}
